              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Includes the scores and lyrics of all songs in the Beneath the White Cloak thirty-year commemorative show."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Fine laminated pages, printed with the best ink, long-lasting collector's edition."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "List price: 2000 shield"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6afabb7722e18e5c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Beneath the White Cloak"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "— \"The Lady in White\" Rebecca's frost mask"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Officially licensed merchandise modeled after the mask of the popular character \"The Lady in White\" Rebecca."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Made with a transparent and crystalline material, the mask also contains a hidden elastic band to adjust tightness, designed to fit the average head circumference of audiences of different ages."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
